            <li>Downlink: S-band 2.25 GHz, 10 W, 12 dBi antenna, 34 m class ground station (G/T 40 dB/K), 2 Mbps, 7.5 dB required Eb/N0 including losses, up to 6 dB multipath fade at grazing angles.</li>
